{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# TeXConversion Base Unit Tests\n\nUnit tests for the base TeXConversion module:\n- Wrapper conversions (R, CR, SF, Op, Interacting)\n- Arithmetic (Plus, Times, Power, Rational)\n- Ghost fields (b, c, bt, ct)\n- Kronecker delta",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Needs[\"StringCode`\"]\nStringCode`InitStringCode[<|\"theory\" -> \"Bosonic\", \"CFT\" -> \"FlatSpace\", \"conventions\"-> \"Bosonic-Xi\", \"bracket\"->\"Flat\"|>]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1770236403518,
     "endTime": 1770236403669
    },
    "executionOrder": 160,
    "success": true
   }
  },
